             middle mouse button down will cause motion to be interpreted as
             scrolling.  Use the --UU option to set the distance the mouse must
             move before the scrolling mode is activated and the --LL option to
             set the scrolling speed.

     --UU _d_i_s_t_a_n_c_e
             When “Virtual Scrolling” is enabled, the --UU option can be used to
